Benchmark Summary & Key Findings:
1. Single-token decode (M=1): Memory-bandwidth bound. Target 180+ GB/s (T4 peak 320 GB/s).
2. Prefill GEMM (M>=64): Compute bound. Target 30+ TFLOP/s (T4 FP16 Tensor Core peak 65 TFLOP/s).
